@host = http://localhost:5290

### 1. Create a ticket
POST {{host}}/api/ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerName": "John hunj",
  "seatNumber": "12A",
  "ticketPrice": 25.50
}

### 2. Get all tickets
GET {{host}}/api/ticket
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get a ticket by id (replace the id with one from step 1)
GET {{host}}/api/ticket/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 4. Update a ticket (replace the id with one from step 1)
PUT {{host}}/api/ticket/ddc3e5d8-3517-4ecf-ae84-3ad51db06ae5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerName": "fcgvbhb Doe",
  "seatNumber": "12B",
  "ticketPrice": 30.00,
  "seatAvailable": false
}

### 5. Delete a ticket (replace the id with one from step 1)
DELETE {{host}}/api/ticket/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 6. Verify deletion — should return 404
GET {{host}}/api/ticket/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
